%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: WerewolfTime2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685787
    - rid: 4351268418678685788
    - rid: 4351268418678685789
    - rid: 4351268418678685790
    - rid: 4351268418678685791
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela's werewolf form made quick of the Silver Hand's preliminary defenses,
      meaning the two of them could enter the fort proper.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685792
    - rid: 4351268418678685793
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You really did a number on those guys...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you really have to... rip their hearts out?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685794
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Merely a part of the thrill of the Hircine's hunt, you should get used
      to it now that you're one of us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Speaking of...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685795
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So how does this <i>curse</i> work, anyway?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685796
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do I need to, like, think wolf thoughts to transform?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: '"Think wolf thoughts," ha!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685797
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: As a result of the beast-blood flowing through your veins, you should
      now feel a thumping every time you see blood or a body.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685798
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>That</i> is the key to the transformation, if you either give into
      or replicate that feeling, you will begin your transformation.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685799
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Releasing the transformation requires suppressing that feeling, which
      is easiest when you're removed from combat.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: It becomes easier to both force and release the transformation as you
      grow with it over time.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And I can just do this whenever?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Not at first, no.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685800
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: The closer you affiliate with Hircine, the more control you'll have over
      your transformation-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: But for werewolves with your experience, you can only transform once
      every moon-raising; once every day.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I see...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685801
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (So I can't transform to deal with the Silver Hand right now.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (No matter how much my blood gets thumping when I saw those bodies...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685802
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The two of them head further into the keep.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685803
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685804
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah jeez....
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685805
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela and Natsuki encounter a dead werewolf that's been strung up in a
      small, closet-sized room.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: That's nobody we've known, judging by the smell.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685806
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Some can't separate the animal from themselves; go feral.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: This poor sod could've been anybody.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d2575c9b40aae842a0e56edb93f9f48, type: 2}
    dialog: And the two of you shall join him!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685807
    - rid: 4351268418678685808
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela and Natsuki are ambushed by members of the Silver Hand. In response,
      Natsuki draws her warhammer.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685809
    - rid: 4351268418678685811
    - rid: 4351268418678685812
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685814
    - rid: 4351268418678685833
    - rid: 4351268418678685834
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You know, Aela...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685835
    - rid: 4351268418678685836
    - rid: 4351268418678685837
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe there wouldn't be a dedicated group of werewolf hunters <i>if</i>
      you didn't keep eating their corpses.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685838
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, you say that, but there's no shortage of fools who seek to destroy
      what they do not understand.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685839
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure, but there'd probably be less of 'em...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685840
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe, but there'd be less free prey for us to hunt.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Seriously?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685841
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess that's why they call her the "Huntress...")
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685842
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685843
    - rid: 4351268418678685844
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As the two of them progress further into the fort, they hear some intense
      fighting coming from further ahead.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: That must be Skjor; we better hurry up before he takes care of everyone.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685845
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Based on what I can hear...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685846
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (It doesn't sound like Skjor's winning...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685847
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685848
    - rid: 4351268418678685849
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Aela and Natsuki encounter a couple of Silver Hand members heading deeper
      into the fort, presumably to aid in the fight against Skjor.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wait, if Skjor was scouting ahead, how did these guys not encounter
      him first?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki's question is partially answered by Aela, as she manages to start
      tearing one of them apart without the others noticing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685850
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh come on, how did no one hear that?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685851
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685852
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela and Natsuki reach the final room of the fort, coincidentally the
      one containing the battle between the Silver Hand and Skjor.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685853
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Unfortunately, it seems that they were too late-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685854
    - rid: 4351268418678685855
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: They get to watch Skjor get skewered, defeated even in his werewolf form.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: You <NoiseText=3,1>bastards</NoiseText>!!!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685856
    - rid: 4351268418678685857
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: We will send you straight to Oblivion, where he will be waiting for you!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela begins literally tearing into the Silver Hand, fueled with the anger
      at seeing Skjor's death.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685858
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As Aela does this, a particularly armored member of the Silver Head squares
      off against Natsuki.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685859
    - rid: 4351268418678685860
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: It seems that Krev was the mightiest opponent present, as everyone else
      was injured by Skjor when he was alive.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685861
    - rid: 4351268418678685864
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Thanks to this, Aela was able to slay everyone else during Natsuki's
      fight.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685862
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Once she knows that there are no more threats, Aela reverts from her
      beast form.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685863
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685865
    - rid: 4351268418678685866
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Skjor...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: You shouldn't have come here without a Shield-Brother...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: You knew that numbers could overwhelm even us...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Funny that <i>you'd</i> say that...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685868
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: You and I have work to do, Shield-Sister.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685869
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll see if there's any information to be gained from their bodies, you
      report back to Jorrvaskr.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>They're going to tremble at our sight</i>...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, as sad as this is, I'm going to catch some shut-eye first.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685870
    - rid: 4351268418678685875
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Thanks for that, by the way-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685872
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Not only did you make me stay up until midnight, but you've also made
      me lose even more sleep as a werewolf.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685871
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So yeah, good night, "<i>Shield-Sister</i>".
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685873
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (It's a good thing I saw a room with some beds in this place...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685874
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
